Z||000011||NEPTUNE||10-24-2001||04:57 PM||||When I did that, I borrowed a CB antenna, worked it between the door glass , upper rear corner and pressed the deck release button (the keys were in the trunk).<BR>Then I went to the parts dept @ the dealer and bought emergency keys. One each, round and square, made of soft plastic, looks like a credit card and fits in your wallet.<BR>Works great unless you lock your wallet in the car....||||reg||3
